Let size be 3.
Let rank be 3.
Set rank to rank minus 1.
Let available be an empty list of whole numbers.
For every digit from 1 to size.
Append digit to available.

Let block be 1.
For every step from 2 to size minus 1.
Set block to block times step.

Let result be empty text.
Let last be size minus 1.
For every position from 0 to last.
Let index be rank divided by block.
Set rank to rank modulo block.
Let chosen be item index of available.
Remove item index of available.
Append 48 plus chosen to result.
If position is less than last, set block to block divided by (last minus position).

Print result.
